        scheme: ["At zeroth order sinθ = 0 regardless of λ, so all wavelengths coincide in one direction", "For n ≥ 1, sinθ = nλ/d grows with wavelength, so red deviates more than blue", "The superposition of all colours at θ = 0 re-forms white; separated elsewhere, they resolve into a spectrum"],
